@startuml
title 批次提交与异步质量校验流程 + 接收 HKICL 派发与退票处理（合并图）

participant Bank as "Bank\n(收单行/代收行/柜员)"
participant Device as "Capture Device\n(扫描器 / 移动 SDK)"
participant Clearing as "Clearing Hub\n(入库/中央校验/清算路由)"
participant HKICL as "HKICL\n(集中派发/接收 IRD)"
participant Core as "Core Banking\n(账户/余额/止付查询)"
participant Ops as "Ops / Manual Review\n(人工复核/授权)"

== 柜面采集与提交 ==
Bank -> Device : Place cheque / capture
Device --> Bank : Capture Result (images, micr, hash, qc_flags)
Bank -> Clearing : Capture Batch Submission (batch_id, images, metadata)
Clearing -> Bank : Immediate Receipt ACK

== Clearing 中央校验 (包含自动验印) ==
Clearing -> Clearing : Central validation & OCR & signature check
opt signature low confidence
  Clearing -> Ops : create manual review task
  Ops -> Clearing : review & auth
end
Clearing -> Core : query account status & balance
Core --> Clearing : account status / stop-pay / balance
Clearing -> Clearing : payability decision
alt payable
  Clearing -> Clearing : include in settlement instruction
else not_payable
  Clearing -> Clearing : assign return_code
  Clearing -> Clearing : generate IRD Image Return File
  Clearing -> HKICL : send IRD Return File (before cutoff)
  Clearing -> Bank : notify collecting bank / sync return
  Bank -> Customer : send e-return notice
end

== HKICL 主动派发场景（午夜 presentment） ==
HKICL -> Clearing : Presentment File (images + metadata)
Clearing -> Clearing : ingest & bucket by payer
Clearing -> Clearing : automatic verification & payability decision
... (same as above processing for returned/paid) ...

@enduml
